Package: IonFamilies
Title: Isotope and Adduct Annotation of LC-MS Feature Groups
Version: 0.99.2
Authors@R:
    person("Jan", "Stanstrup", email = "stanstrup@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Annotates the ion family of a compound, i.e. its isotopes,
    adducts and in-source fragments, within groups of LC-MS features such as
    those defined by `groupFeatures()` from the 'MsFeatures' and 'xcms'
    packages. Isotope patterns are detected with
    `MetaboCoreUtils::isotopologues()`. Adducts and fragments are found by
    neutral-mass voting with a rule list: every supported neutral-mass
    hypothesis is kept and ranked, so that annotations can be used as
    hints. Results are stored in the `featureDefinitions()` of an
    `XcmsExperiment` in a CAMERA-compatible format.
